[{"key": "636ed01b63f6a1db712f366a907a83e3", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "THE IDEA BEHIND ÉLAN", "href": null}, {"key": "443dedd6963f54e2cbdfe0af413d68f7", "page": "about.html", "tag": "em", "text": "bringing to life.", "href": null}, {"key": "a2de2250f38e7ec2a3c1c672900b4732", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "01 / WHERE IT BEGAN", "href": null}, {"key": "b5a1e24aa8dabca8e9fafc9d032087aa", "page": "about.html", "tag": "em", "text": "a conversation.", "href": null}, {"key": "c4f753707ca9b50481b96ac290315d49", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Walking back from lunch, Akshit Parmar and Jacinth Jebaraj began talking about an idea. That conversation became the starting point for Élan, founded by Akshit with co-founders Sakshi Baldawa, Prachi Belagali and Jacinth.", "href": null}, {"key": "8ebfa26bb2b6853c9c26079927bc9052", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The first Élan Summit took place at SGIS Pune Campus, Mulshi, on 5–6 September 2026. Across two days, the committee rooms and stage became the setting for our first chapter.", "href": null}, {"key": "02e6dfe8757f40c96e60477a74f17ed2", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "02 / THE PURPOSE", "href": null}, {"key": "29e5aff971c4cf06a601dc2e6637cdfd", "page": "about.html", "tag": "em", "text": "take part.", "href": null}, {"key": "f02b2aebe867fe877a091d19cc7258ce", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "We wanted students to have a part in the event, not just a seat in the audience.", "href": null}, {"key": "bbc94812d9ab459825278cf1d801020f", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "At the first Élan Summit, students formed cabinets, worked through business challenges and presented decisions they had made together. The sessions gave them a reason to speak up and listen to people from other schools.", "href": null}, {"key": "9d43b77c36caa80d582d7681de2c1aa8", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Outside the committee rooms, there were performances, conversations and a DJ night. Those shared moments were part of what we wanted Élan to be.", "href": null}, {"key": "31aecde2f6d23fdde9ff39aea0f1354a", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Make leadership, creativity and collaboration something young people can practise together.", "href": null}, {"key": "0bfc045e3cb9e04baaec2e602f5db110", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "03 / THE ORIGINAL FLAGSHIPS", "href": null}, {"key": "b520a2c9d2ef55a84f0f78ea4df95274", "page": "about.html", "tag": "em", "text": "need to think.", "href": null}, {"key": "5fea9e17a5e836ddcac897df0cbc0b54", "page": "about.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Command.", "href": null}, {"key": "e8d4287b547b6a941afe602c09476a3f", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "A nation in crisis. A cabinet under pressure. Work with your team, weigh the consequences and defend a response.", "href": null}, {"key": "4519b350f8c51e92e36e0710be8f2913", "page": "about.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Cent$ible.", "href": null}, {"key": "2d1b793e74bdcb3e0c9e544eccee5ac1", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Build a brand or navigate a market. Bring strategy, creativity and judgement to a business arena that keeps changing.", "href": null}, {"key": "cb031b060878645e10abc9b5d194500a", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "In the 2026 edition, the two flagships ran in parallel. For the second edition, Crisis Command will be the sole flagship. Cent$ible remains part of our first-edition story.", "href": null}, {"key": "0893f3e858aa33a3935e8026f0636956", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "04 / WHAT MAKES IT ÉLAN", "href": null}, {"key": "0acf9bde6396d1de605eb64e0f975fcb", "page": "about.html", "tag": "em", "text": "competition.", "href": null}, {"key": "e423da6e938c24432f9f34332136521f", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "What happens between the sessions matters too.", "href": null}, {"key": "76f3c0ef42e6f3c954dc50bc82f7e111", "page": "about.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Room to express yourself.", "href": null}, {"key": "450da2b654545f51884a38d7e9e69fb1", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "A stage for performance, a platform for ideas and the confidence to put something of your own into the world.", "href": null}, {"key": "007e55cc9f736cdff688a367f55ceed5", "page": "about.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Responsibility you can feel.", "href": null}, {"key": "4cc6841cdc6482309f3c6d841e8ede15", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "From cabinet decisions to organising and volunteering, students take ownership of work that affects other people.", "href": null}, {"key": "7a4a105c1f521177db5519bdb86fb1bd", "page": "about.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Connections beyond your school.", "href": null}, {"key": "cf58390751607a0da65a030e4773b72d", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Mixed-school teams, shared activities and conversations give people a reason to meet and work together.", "href": null}, {"key": "204d9dfd2ccf007a834e0751f08a33f4", "page": "about.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Care in the details.", "href": null}, {"key": "e647c15755afc65caf570211a58deb4b", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The way people are welcomed, the spaces they share and the time between sessions all shape what they remember.", "href": null}, {"key": "70af5770770ff5b54bbf6dbc688130d8", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "05 / THERE IS A PLACE FOR YOU", "href": null}, {"key": "1dbbeca4a2592006f3d97ba539cfdc7c", "page": "about.html", "tag": "em", "text": "build the room.", "href": null}, {"key": "39a41ca7f7c2fd134eb0dd035145bd4c", "page": "about.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Take part.", "href": null}, {"key": "fcd605685041b1b85f4142fde6d5221b", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Explore an experience built around creativity, confidence and working with others.", "href": null}, {"key": "62df75a29894fa8523a9dea14d177597", "page": "about.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Make it happen.", "href": null}, {"key": "a52560239961975c66117793e16be7ca", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Help shape the details and bring the next chapter of Élan to life.", "href": null}, {"key": "48ff617cd742d9857f05528dc281e825", "page": "about.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Build with us.", "href": null}, {"key": "d2aa378dfe675ad99f829a275d618c0d", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Speak with the team about supporting young people and future editions.", "href": null}, {"key": "9e2008c23ffa1552ed4c2d6371bd927d", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Dates, venue and participation details for the next edition have not yet been announced.", "href": null}, {"key": "0f972932c75be4ae99de95f0fac08a5d", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "06 / THE FOUNDING TEAM", "href": null}, {"key": "8f15e35479007bccc23715a12b3c51e6", "page": "about.html", "tag": "em", "text": "founding team.", "href": null}, {"key": "df20965029943e63fee95ad77d7cb733", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Founded by Akshit Parmar, with co-founders Sakshi Baldawa, Prachi Belagali and Jacinth Jebaraj.", "href": null}, {"key": "a8bc1db47e2df55be82cc8cf5fc21983", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "A CONVERSATION STARTS HERE", "href": null}, {"key": "f702d8b61266f4d61cbbbb5f8a574782", "page": "about.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Akshit Parmar", "href": null}, {"key": "999b5b79f60925e51dd424c6f24860d7", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Founder & Director / Élan 2026", "href": null}, {"key": "065925d990d8529681c511c4ae393f0f", "page": "about.html", "tag": "p", "text": "For school participation, volunteering, media or collaboration, get in touch directly.", "href": null}, {"key": "7f306e3d98beaf4a634bf4323c7fd05f", "page": "about.html", "tag": "a", "text": "the.elan.summit@gmail.com ↗", "href": "mailto:the.elan.summit@gmail.com"}, {"key": "3c3a28be88c6d8aa8f345b0f920d9026", "page": "about.html", "tag": "a", "text": "+91 8160215010 ↗", "href": "tel:+918160215010"}, {"key": "307a93c26c5a8336190639d34d6c9c0d", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "p", "text": "ÉLAN / THE ORIGINAL EDITION", "href": null}, {"key": "b5445b77b2d90bafc32c6a55e9bf9f0e", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Kept here.", "href": null}, {"key": "3ee7ae484d925da2ddd278f99313837f", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The story, the programme and the details of our first edition, together in one place.", "href": null}, {"key": "4ee303b54ccd8c6057f1a6877ae39783", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "em", "text": "chapter.", "href": null}, {"key": "c2af322c75c5d002cc4f3fda0e8f62a5", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "The programme.", "href": null}, {"key": "94628565b29b67d7582117a03edff787", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Explore the original two-day schedule, from the opening to the final ceremony.", "href": null}, {"key": "5ff174eb3363f8d51df6d69a1139ec14", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Inside the arenas.", "href": null}, {"key": "30427594782ae8727167bc04505d066f", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Discover the roles, rounds and challenges behind Crisis Command and Cent$ible.", "href": null}, {"key": "a7334cc31f4138721c5a07bf1bb69086", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Our collaborators.", "href": null}, {"key": "2f75e35d708ad6b11aa6d079596d802b", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The organisations and partners represented in the original edition.", "href": null}, {"key": "a1e451a67837190d7d66e079da36805f", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "p", "text": "THE REFERENCE DESK", "href": null}, {"key": "0e79edf2415f98b4e70ba08ef24b8b18", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Still within reach.", "href": null}, {"key": "fb2113301fe6f2626e32291de5d9c2b7", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Dates, passes, formats and policies in the archive describe the 2026 edition. They do not set the terms for a future event.", "href": null}, {"key": "7c4b46140f0a7db722f72ea3fdf9c076", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "The experience", "href": null}, {"key": "c9991c6948cacacfcb53acd90a5fb985", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Participation", "href": null}, {"key": "fcf3683bcf1b18ca33856841f39e408a", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Policies", "href": null}, {"key": "60c4a923cbd2daea5f75de73ec7afb0f", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "p", "text": "THE STORY CONTINUES", "href": null}, {"key": "9723936cd71439254d2c9ef2e2c1ba42", "page": "archive.html", "tag": "em", "text": "what comes next?", "href": null}, {"key": "3a2b1ddbd1d821c53c5958d787c8f170", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "p", "text": "ÉLAN / CONTACT", "href": null}, {"key": "07765efd7ed6f77841726b1f971886f3", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "p", "text": "School participation, volunteering, partnerships or a question about the first edition: tell us what brings you here.", "href": null}, {"key": "3520f048b0062433f2c23cd2bce48a0f", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Akshit Parmar", "href": null}, {"key": "6b5fcdfd4a32ab0ba385c31ba4b1523f", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Tell us what you need.", "href": null}, {"key": "a928d1ff6b849f52864c4bf22f3414d3", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Share your school, interests or question, along with a way to reach you.", "href": null}, {"key": "06073a84c173ba470c6e78bfc190e515", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "We’ll take it from there.", "href": null}, {"key": "796b05700ee6784ddfcb7a02826778dd", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The organising team reviews your message and follows up using the details you provide.", "href": null}, {"key": "d7157481e196b34e6b1700f30014c70d", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Agree the details.", "href": null}, {"key": "411b4a1ed52d02c739ed2b8e886b7f0f", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Dates, responsibilities and any costs are confirmed before you commit.", "href": null}, {"key": "6a32afc43006c55fa9598555a4c438fb", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "p", "text": "START A CONVERSATION", "href": null}, {"key": "db1a3ae21f6c3171b634aedee95e6060", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Include the edition your question relates to. For a school or partnership enquiry, share your organisation and the best way to reach you.", "href": null}, {"key": "33959846bfbd17c29c9ddcc12b3ffe48", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "a", "text": "the.elan.summit@gmail.com ↗", "href": "mailto:the.elan.summit@gmail.com"}, {"key": "d1e134ad382ab0e778eb2645f8486c1a", "page": "contact.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Your enquiry is saved for the organising team. It does not reserve a place or confirm a volunteer role.", "href": null}, {"key": "18c43cd603bb34b4e80370dfcec65ffc", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "p", "text": "ÉLAN / YOUR QUESTIONS", "href": null}, {"key": "8bda984358c9832d5465110f5703ec46", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "em", "text": "made clear.", "href": null}, {"key": "18678c3ae2f31bf85051ad40f0a45a53", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "p", "text": "What is known about the second edition, what is still being planned, and where to find the first-edition record.", "href": null}, {"key": "a2aaa44edfbb7905761b557764bedfa1", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Crisis Command will be the only flagship. Cent$ible remains part of the 2026 archive and will not continue in the second edition.", "href": null}, {"key": "7c8b55d15c41fee50183095e4e548777", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Dates and venue have not been announced. The September 2026 dates and SGIS Mulshi venue belong to the first edition.", "href": null}, {"key": "1de0cc2cdc5908eeab43052204824b3f", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Registration and payments for the second edition are not open. Archived pass prices are not second-edition prices.", "href": null}, {"key": "c1a0af18c5d37b0371c827028bab1236", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Eligibility, team size and the detailed format for the second edition will be announced before registration. The first-edition rules remain available for reference.", "href": null}, {"key": "baa88669b2816955b6ee51438d3052e1", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "a", "text": "school enquiry page", "href": "/schools.html#enquire"}, {"key": "7c394d8f621dfa25956545330d897564", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "a", "text": "volunteer enquiry", "href": "/volunteers.html#enquire"}, {"key": "1350f8e16e1e8ceaec3eb5d438d4f7b9", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "a", "text": "contact the team", "href": "/contact.html#enquire"}, {"key": "60ed7b7e287c4e9a1bfaec087747ba2f", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Yes. It securely saves your enquiry for the organising team. An enquiry does not reserve a place or create a participant account.", "href": null}, {"key": "e18086124e39612314210b3abaa76900", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "a", "text": "2026 archive", "href": "/archive.html"}, {"key": "d07b04438811479da82b1f1108461eed", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "a", "text": "original-edition FAQs", "href": "/faqs-2026.html"}, {"key": "cb7aa80bda6dae2edc610b17133fd44a", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Still have a question?", "href": null}, {"key": "224ff02026b5e212d53a449e45044af3", "page": "faqs.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Ask the team ↗", "href": "/contact.html#enquire"}, {"key": "a61157179cbfede49dbf81c8c457c7c8", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "a", "text": "← THE 2026 EDITION", "href": "/archive.html"}, {"key": "3868e04d0b62e229f519cab2d9b16662", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "5–6 SEPTEMBER 2026 / MULSHI, PUNE", "href": null}, {"key": "327324e13a5f2eacd3ae77732308c3e9", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "em", "text": "chapter.", "href": null}, {"key": "321948944a38fdf115eaa222e1f20531", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "ÉLAN / THE FIRST EDITION", "href": null}, {"key": "f254ce5eba6a6ac2784977931948bd8d", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "em", "text": "applause.", "href": null}, {"key": "93b5a78a9ed214f1202b17090f518ca0", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "A stage, two competitive arenas and the people who brought them to life. This is a look inside the first Élan Summit at SGIS Pune Campus, Mulshi. Here are the sessions and the moments around them.", "href": null}, {"key": "5a861aeee7332e9589a25e246e314dae", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "5 September 2026", "href": null}, {"key": "47f42be217f726e44ec45aaaf474d3ed", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "strong", "text": "The first move.", "href": null}, {"key": "13ae0b3390836e6f421fb550ac9989a6", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "DAY ONE / OPENING CEREMONY", "href": null}, {"key": "d8922b25f9948521bf49bfc405794ead", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "em", "text": "welcome.", "href": null}, {"key": "c92b34247dde3716944b12421857aeaa", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Before the committee rooms, everyone came together. Performances and addresses opened the summit, introducing the people and ideas that would shape the next two days.", "href": null}, {"key": "0ecba88c3e68246a72f1b332ed3a32de", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "On stage: a performance from the first day.", "href": null}, {"key": "40cdbbac910f65f2c97ef03655cbdc31", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "DAY ONE / COMMITTEE SESSIONS", "href": null}, {"key": "9497e24e23f3f6e9d7e3102c8eb514ab", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The focus shifted from the stage to the table. Across Crisis Command and Cent$ible, participants listened, exchanged ideas and worked through the decisions in front of them.", "href": null}, {"key": "741ca374832de0a65d520f468b94f644", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Around the table: listening, exchanging views and working as a team.", "href": null}, {"key": "cf809b54a0f2035e3dfd72dc417025c5", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Explore Crisis Command ↗", "href": "/flagship.html"}, {"key": "5f8303ae924a8a6e9fd0decf9f81adac", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Explore Cent$ible ↗", "href": "/centsible.html"}, {"key": "d5f5f2839bdb052c70967d0975f345c0", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "DAY ONE / DJ NIGHT", "href": null}, {"key": "ce4f9493fa829c98ed9f62dd8ec96b3b", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "em", "text": "the music.", "href": null}, {"key": "096c9aac10f4482b1d05fb8694d288bc", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The conversations gave way to music. DJ night brought people together on the dance floor for a shared celebration after a day spent in different rooms.", "href": null}, {"key": "91f05620b0dd22f5676d976c6e9ac7dd", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "6 September 2026", "href": null}, {"key": "95b7d5c13f70a60d8a6d1025e3074ab2", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "strong", "text": "Carry it forward.", "href": null}, {"key": "31e2d1f059c0a5e86406cd0ba9ce5c5c", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "DAY TWO / COMMITTEE SESSIONS", "href": null}, {"key": "02cc203aafa80673592b6f34bd0b829b", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "em", "text": "the table.", "href": null}, {"key": "b0854454203935f2825d4c16ba65fac4", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Day 2 brought participants back to their respective arenas. Teams picked up the work of the first day, continuing their discussions and preparing for the concluding stages.", "href": null}, {"key": "650f8e1ccf91c223a26325721cbda8d3", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "A delegation photographed together during the second day.", "href": null}, {"key": "d0d7ad311235baa3b2beb20d4b31148d", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "DAY TWO / CLOSING CEREMONY", "href": null}, {"key": "32104e1133bf06f50f97c5f21b6cf161", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "em", "text": "gathering.", "href": null}, {"key": "816890594b6baad2078494f2a2c2478b", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The summit returned to a shared stage for its closing ceremony: a chance to reflect on the two days and acknowledge the people behind them.", "href": null}, {"key": "3ab18667fe6ef67cc7b43ebe06b9963f", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "From the Day 2 collection: an address on stage.", "href": null}, {"key": "d11458a7c4fc2c44cee39843ab2d9457", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "AWARDS & FELICITATIONS", "href": null}, {"key": "30e78ad41ef63bbbfc996ddce76071fd", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "em", "text": "recognition.", "href": null}, {"key": "44e357e7242740861c1af841471a0e31", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The final chapter made space for achievement and contribution. Awards and felicitations brought participants and the people supporting them into the spotlight.", "href": null}, {"key": "49ca508634890106417ac3cd0c078c59", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "A presentation on stage, captured during Day 2.", "href": null}, {"key": "e4d2fd706fe19e30340d3a48f5b1c1fc", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "THE FIRST CHAPTER IS PART OF OUR STORY.", "href": null}, {"key": "f47520befe91299ce79c896a8c3407d6", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "em", "text": "being written.", "href": null}, {"key": "36f418cfb6985c8cce2f98e7d2f52454", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Explore the 2026 edition ↗", "href": "/archive.html"}, {"key": "859c40354cb5b41e30c5e2e82c15bb33", "page": "first-edition.html", "tag": "a", "text": "The next chapter ↗", "href": "/next-edition.html"}, {"key": "cb4f3a9768ff0f51029d0c01731414c5", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "a", "text": "ÉLAN / THE CRISIS SIMULATION", "href": "/archive.html"}, {"key": "b02c2eb3617820e85b63b5c4a1b7556b", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Command.", "href": null}, {"key": "f00a4c24d12b882176da50087c488156", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Take your place in an emergency cabinet. Read the crisis, negotiate a response and defend the choices your nation will live with.", "href": null}, {"key": "c7913547e1e95e03a03924038d8ebc62", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Not all the answers.", "href": null}, {"key": "e6d3ab21ac6ca2b525eb890451dd5cb3", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Your team represents a fictional country facing a crisis. There are resources to manage, other nations to negotiate with and people depending on your decisions.", "href": null}, {"key": "633c7b827e58158fc8ca1a86a98ef2c9", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Then new information arrives. The plan you agreed on five minutes ago might no longer work.", "href": null}, {"key": "ba5dc08d786ca4280e365ebcbda65e40", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Explore the full photo story ↗", "href": "/first-edition.html"}, {"key": "255d82d655a118d141e8d2cef1745614", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "One country, three responsibilities. Each person brings a different perspective. Your job is to turn those perspectives into a shared response.", "href": null}, {"key": "be2f0524d45495625b058951aeffba7f", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Head of State", "href": null}, {"key": "86baddd0fd9708b72e61b4b774897ca9", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Sets the direction, holds the team together, makes the final calls, and presents the national response with authority.", "href": null}, {"key": "79f8b563931e55d9abf62639c7d369f7", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Sets the strategy and priorities for the crisis", "href": null}, {"key": "21cd08af2db04aa886b6959470baf5be", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Chairs every discussion and breaks deadlocks", "href": null}, {"key": "b3a2a8451ea55f56858bd34a430d03c0", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Balances the priorities of both ministers", "href": null}, {"key": "19581e8f1648bfe3407fa980bf8d05f1", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Leads the final presentation to the judges", "href": null}, {"key": "65ee4d45312cd135b51bf00bdd484c9a", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Finance Minister", "href": null}, {"key": "eba3462e0d27aff198df79124d536281", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Controls the national budget. Nothing the cabinet proposes happens unless it can be funded.", "href": null}, {"key": "21de20eda36c99fffc3264e4a476c989", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Manages the budget and resources across both days", "href": null}, {"key": "8fac2c5f76781a09f8068b630e2c4b15", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Costs every proposal and flags what cannot be afforded", "href": null}, {"key": "d0001ba21647217088b45f8fb6a50ea0", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Allocates between relief, security and infrastructure", "href": null}, {"key": "70a9ddf889f474a4d95241f51e41985b", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Defends the plan's financial feasibility", "href": null}, {"key": "7b3aef8028086e259bcc96ead023840c", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Foreign Affairs Minister", "href": null}, {"key": "010d359d12629cfb0c5576d11f9d3eee", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Represents your country in the room. Builds alliances, negotiates support and works to ease tensions.", "href": null}, {"key": "3d96b758931f316edc82ef73f7849d6c", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Manages relations with the other nations in the room", "href": null}, {"key": "1ff7979bba747cec731f30e486150238", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Leads negotiations for aid, alliances and agreements", "href": null}, {"key": "a98971d443647e861b5b2bf07d045503", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Eases tensions when the crisis crosses borders", "href": null}, {"key": "da4e5fdf073dbbd225d9827e14ebe1e0", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Keeps the cabinet's decisions from isolating the nation", "href": null}, {"key": "ef171ea90fbbbe545d37690280de5900", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "em", "text": "will change.", "href": null}, {"key": "4eccab918bbdb238aae52d3902c54f4c", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The three phases below describe the 2026 format. Details for the next edition will be confirmed separately.", "href": null}, {"key": "c3266e8bfd6467cc9efdeb9b38d7bd1c", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Read the room.", "href": null}, {"key": "da64ad797ac8054b27eb4de8920bcf54", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Your country profile, resources and first intelligence packet are on the table. Work out what matters, divide responsibilities and agree on your first response.", "href": null}, {"key": "67496058babc76f7e1c61265df3d36dd", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Understand the crisis and your country's position", "href": null}, {"key": "8a54213cddd8bbe28e2f25d83664e31e", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Set priorities across the three cabinet roles", "href": null}, {"key": "5abc26db6827c6eaff527dc73971ce0f", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Submit the Initial Response Brief", "href": null}, {"key": "22bfe8273ef1af50b18cc2b1121619bf", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "The facts have changed.", "href": null}, {"key": "22938475bbbe2c3f2c97a35d92f74130", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Fresh intelligence changes the picture. Other countries react. Public trust shifts. Decide what to keep, what to change and how to explain it.", "href": null}, {"key": "ae61241bc34c4a33da08af55773c7d15", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Reassess the risks and available resources", "href": null}, {"key": "0fe6b728c57b398ea70368c3e79aa920", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Negotiate with other nations", "href": null}, {"key": "e3671a413e659fd5f336e3f7893777cc", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Prepare your public response", "href": null}, {"key": "637c5ebbc7a5460c166b84505c5cbcff", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Stand behind your choices.", "href": null}, {"key": "19b2557c809f0f723811b6cbcbab0f2f", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Bring the cabinet's work together. The top teams present their response to the panel, answer questions and explain the decisions that brought them here.", "href": null}, {"key": "b6bbc0d803394be64de695603ab858d2", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Submit the final plan", "href": null}, {"key": "f68ff8a3a92bd53dd05526a81edf3907", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Present the cabinet's response", "href": null}, {"key": "4a7fca2b2a6cdddbdf8d5774177b62f5", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "li", "text": "Defend it under questioning", "href": null}, {"key": "38e0861176220d86b9068ccfc98845ae", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Convince us it can work.", "href": null}, {"key": "0c6fb307fb67b9101dbd1b2197131f1d", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Judges look at the decisions behind your presentation: whether your plan can work, who it affects and how well your cabinet responds together.", "href": null}, {"key": "60f04073d72b13febd0c742c5b159481", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Leadership", "href": null}, {"key": "362a355311cbe698adbe74196763e17e", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Calm direction, team coordination, initiative, and decision-making under pressure.", "href": null}, {"key": "f534d45188636e3408f59b902811cbeb", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Strategy", "href": null}, {"key": "b0e5b9dd028c33c5f746328410a4ec75", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Clear priorities, practical planning, smart trade-offs, and long-term thinking.", "href": null}, {"key": "6aa66d96b86776f2bbd3c6c6c77d92f2", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Feasible actions that consider resources, timelines, stakeholders, and consequences.", "href": null}, {"key": "d94c8ce3b62bd63f81f757b01337aefb", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Fair, responsible decisions that balance urgency with human impact.", "href": null}, {"key": "1ebff9224e7c9d6eac1be2692c8a69ca", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Communication", "href": null}, {"key": "bda469fd022d15ca2e45d54241e73866", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Strong public messaging, clear presentation, and confident defense of choices.", "href": null}, {"key": "a21aa4cfa231d0b538150474bccb7d3d", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Adaptability", "href": null}, {"key": "4f3aed4ebb37266fe137b445c7d13491", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The ability to respond when the situation changes and old plans stop working.", "href": null}, {"key": "0640234d24f20b49e586f3ddbbd2ee0d", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Enter the crisis room.", "href": null}, {"key": "07ffa37c4b9208bb985287abd0452183", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Crisis Command returns for the second edition. Explore participation details or talk to us about bringing your school.", "href": null}, {"key": "71191f2423b22becd2f9cab3ec085f78", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Next-edition updates ↗", "href": "/next-edition.html"}, {"key": "bc62f0cfe7703c60571de7c01a4479b7", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Bring a School Delegation", "href": "schools.html"}, {"key": "28a8c1d904daf84a91fd32348df46566", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The first edition offered ₹10,000 to the winning council. Second-edition prizes have not been announced.", "href": null}, {"key": "0f66e55b742c1867f667574839ce6bdd", "page": "flagship.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Explore Cent$ible 2026 ↗", "href": null}, {"key": "e98bdf768fce77a4632df826d888f2b0", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "ÉLAN / THE FOUNDING TEAM", "href": null}, {"key": "39794168c97f16cd3e8da88c6674da5d", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Akshit founded Élan with co-founders Sakshi, Prachi and Jacinth. Here are the interests, conversations and people behind its first edition.", "href": null}, {"key": "8194a2b03c670ebac687ea79c6fce938", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "01 / FOUNDER", "href": null}, {"key": "0858911fc6a9b0cbffdd2bf9660561ef", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Director · Élan 2026", "href": null}, {"key": "df374bfa5075aadb5e2785a5649f0702", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Chess, coastlines and a curiosity about the universe.", "href": null}, {"key": "49ff08a026f4ab4450c7bf8b3059bfb5", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "I’m Akshit Parmar, the founder of Élan and the Director of its 2026 edition. I enjoy chess, gaming and spending time at the beach. I’m also aiming to become an astrophysicist. I want to understand more about the universe and how it works.", "href": null}, {"key": "d951d5d369194fc30fe050a8289d096b", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Élan has been a dream project of mine. Getting to bring it to life made the first edition especially personal. More than anything, I hope everyone who joined us enjoyed being part of it and left with something they’ll remember fondly.", "href": null}, {"key": "6bc2d545903f92414c950e4d0c801aaf", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "02 / CO-FOUNDER", "href": null}, {"key": "476482231cd8cac97647ad929dd151a3", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Baldawa.", "href": null}, {"key": "825357286a8e5ea6d393cf23a2a044f1", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Assistant Director · Élan 2026", "href": null}, {"key": "4e34f50903602097fb963c33afd59c81", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Curiosity in business. Creativity in expression.", "href": null}, {"key": "27e306687528c4b3f5dd502132b45cce", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Sakshi Baldawa is a co-founder of Élan Summit and served as Assistant Director of its 2026 edition. With a keen interest in finance, business and economics, she enjoys exploring new ideas, connecting with people and turning thought into action.", "href": null}, {"key": "ca5f379a81cb105de3c85014664b7970", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Dance is another expression of that curiosity and energy. Alongside her academic interests and leadership work, it gives her space to create and express herself. She enjoys working with others, taking initiative and learning as she goes.", "href": null}, {"key": "7dce06e53b87e6dd5408e6004ad77deb", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "03 / CO-FOUNDER", "href": null}, {"key": "42ced38b1521955bc0fa0b8c93e939d2", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Belagali.", "href": null}, {"key": "be6f37979880cdcb2e52de185d2be305", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "One of the Heads of All Departments · Élan 2026", "href": null}, {"key": "11678d9ed44c948ec1bb0887b4d47468", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Curious about people, perspectives and the questions in between.", "href": null}, {"key": "2107c2947c0c5ef0761244694e3963cd", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "I’m Prachi Belagali. I’m drawn to law and history, especially the questions they raise about people: what shapes our beliefs, why we think differently, and how another perspective can change our own. Outside academics, Taekwondo has been a big part of my life, teaching me discipline, resilience and the importance of showing up when things get difficult.", "href": null}, {"key": "8253a3ca9716bc1ca27b90c3fe4512e9", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "I’ve never believed learning ends at the classroom door. Some of my most meaningful lessons have come from conversations, disagreements and experiences that challenged what I thought I knew. I’m still figuring things out, and I enjoy that uncertainty.", "href": null}, {"key": "57eafe5a294fd39c935a62d1701c7e34", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "As a co-founder of Élan and one of the Heads of All Departments for its 2026 edition, I had the chance to exchange ideas with people who see the world differently. What stayed with me were the questions worth thinking about long after those conversations ended.", "href": null}, {"key": "b17be6825bc5640eb2bfc12a6c7967ec", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "04 / CO-FOUNDER", "href": null}, {"key": "69e6507e6da132c7635c12c2fa3654db", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "em", "text": "Jebaraj.", "href": null}, {"key": "b646a1d9b3ac9313b4aa9410ffc986a6", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Élan Summit", "href": null}, {"key": "4788215bcb46439cf08b0c2c8b652bd2", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "A conversation. An idea. A beginning.", "href": null}, {"key": "b5b40c20d0f84669902e0e394a9b567a", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "I’m Jacinth Jebaraj, a co-founder of Élan. I’m passionate about economics, business management and understanding how an idea becomes something people can be part of.", "href": null}, {"key": "e8b2b91958e8a71fe98ad27d3418d4db", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Élan began with a conversation between Akshit, our founder, and me as we walked back from lunch. What felt like an ordinary conversation became the starting point for something we would build together.", "href": null}, {"key": "64803b34dad67f0aa337928fadd6a1a9", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "I enjoy exploring possibilities, learning from the people around me and taking that first step towards an idea. For me, Élan is a reminder of what can happen when people take an idea seriously and give it a chance to grow.", "href": null}, {"key": "c477634e3ba6cf0c0a7e7e5c55d0c3ee", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "p", "text": "FROM THE PEOPLE TO THE EXPERIENCE", "href": null}, {"key": "5d87341d968a745ff0ed8ce1fb9f3acd", "page": "founders.html", "tag": "em", "text": "together.", "href": null}, {"key": "bf243f450ad4e4b424cd1099eed543a6", "page": "next-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "ÉLAN / WHAT COMES NEXT", "href": null}, {"key": "c41ab7971a57c29270ce3c118923a728", "page": "next-edition.html", "tag": "em", "text": "next edition.", "href": null}, {"key": "d8a2acfbf7eabaadf68dd3d4f60459db", "page": "next-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The second edition will centre on Crisis Command as its only flagship. Cent$ible will not continue in this edition. Dates, venue, passes and registration have not been announced yet.", "href": null}, {"key": "6364c2be7fd8e15dada6162a14b1a351", "page": "next-edition.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Stay close to the story.", "href": null}, {"key": "f48b0407429b0e24cc157ff4c523ed38", "page": "next-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "For school participation, volunteering or partnerships, start a conversation with the organising team.", "href": null}, {"key": "c40c3bb193dfa88098514b122bdb4494", "page": "next-edition.html", "tag": "h2", "text": "Explore the original edition.", "href": null}, {"key": "2bb5ab71d50191c269ac03d6710e5798", "page": "next-edition.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The 2026 programme, flagship formats and policies remain available. They describe the original edition and do not set the terms for the next one.", "href": null}, {"key": "3ba4d2af5e23cd737daabe20c794e2ba", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "p", "text": "ÉLAN / SCHOOL COLLABORATION", "href": null}, {"key": "ec4c811772a87d33394c5e61277fddd9", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "em", "text": "with us.", "href": null}, {"key": "29536bc6fed5c55251485240baddd667", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Bring your students, your ideas and a clear sense of what your school can contribute. Participation and organising collaboration are separate conversations.", "href": null}, {"key": "f889fccf28a9e8f13df2259f902e753b", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "p", "text": "A SHARED RESPONSIBILITY", "href": null}, {"key": "7def020fe955cac8eb86a9aa06bdf023", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "One point of contact.", "href": null}, {"key": "466bc0b3f13dd570538db8171ff619ce", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Nominate a coordinator to discuss student participation, communication and the scope of your school’s involvement.", "href": null}, {"key": "e4952bd9985cc5486cc8667f68bf90f4", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "A contribution that fits.", "href": null}, {"key": "0be426f90bc9886d79594a717ecbc7a0", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Tell us where you can help: outreach, faculty coordination, logistics, venue support or student leadership. Responsibilities are agreed with the organising team.", "href": null}, {"key": "54a4656c9253a68dd330e8ae1b36cb58", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Recognition, agreed together.", "href": null}, {"key": "4ac06eddd617e8a1083d48022633bf71", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Website credit, event visibility and other benefits need to match the agreed contribution. These are discussed individually rather than promised in advance.", "href": null}, {"key": "36dd60caa1fc54d17c5b6d567a7d2465", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Student welfare comes first.", "href": null}, {"key": "d655b28a64c64ec485f93a7635204763", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Supervision, conduct, consent and emergency communication need clear responsibilities before participation is confirmed.", "href": null}, {"key": "1e5b8d0d7286b277078bc38bf554d8a3", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "p", "text": "BEGIN WITH YOUR SCHOOL", "href": null}, {"key": "64855dde86d9450f0a2da2035ed6efc6", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "em", "text": "way to work together.", "href": null}, {"key": "ce35fd232ae2aa59f8787fa9f7421651", "page": "school-collaboration.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Start a school enquiry ↗", "href": "/schools.html#enquire"}, {"key": "a2648b12a7c21cf5a6f0fc22d731cc74", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "ÉLAN / STUDENTS & SCHOOLS", "href": null}, {"key": "767dc633aebef440f6ded200d597c5c6", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "em", "text": "school to take part.", "href": null}, {"key": "09de3952d5f94030c2acd36d1fc3a812", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Explore school participation in the second edition, centred on Crisis Command. Start with a conversation about your students and what they hope to learn.", "href": null}, {"key": "7d9d37aca05cbb08f0c5c1922b06258e", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Send an enquiry ↘", "href": "#enquire"}, {"key": "bc608d76d36d46df12988d3229b6ce93", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Questions & answers ↗", "href": "/faqs.html"}, {"key": "b2fc4ea70272ffefe7ab1b73486c7c94", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "THE EXPERIENCE", "href": null}, {"key": "45791550da3891f9c7d229b06e6b60af", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Decisions, with consequences.", "href": null}, {"key": "99b1201a5c8e6d75aa6ef9e828eb9770", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Crisis Command asks participants to consider competing priorities, respond to changing information and explain their choices.", "href": null}, {"key": "0524270aa1a84232e13c56ab58231f29", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "A team with different strengths.", "href": null}, {"key": "f5765efb06d57b4d01b11b3ec088c114", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Research, listening, negotiation and clear communication all have a place alongside public speaking.", "href": null}, {"key": "5b272e12ba8c08c2a32899cdddffa727", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Planning with your coordinator.", "href": null}, {"key": "bc8cbd7c41ce5ebb6ac4e250f73c62e8", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Share your estimated group size and practical needs. Eligibility, pricing, supervision, travel and the programme will be confirmed before registration opens.", "href": null}, {"key": "6fa959e0932dfed92dc8deb247500090", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Tell us what you need.", "href": null}, {"key": "146ad175e3438ec6ea7506f821906ff5", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Share your school, interests or question, along with a way to reach you.", "href": null}, {"key": "415cf9faee0352e6d010c43ce766d102", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "We’ll take it from there.", "href": null}, {"key": "1c65718e2f4666ea6631defd824020f7", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The organising team reviews your message and follows up using the details you provide.", "href": null}, {"key": "5d0986b2faeeb60d804ac640c62b7e07", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Agree the details.", "href": null}, {"key": "3d82f39c86cbb7886d47296935c5ca85", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Dates, responsibilities and any costs are confirmed before you commit.", "href": null}, {"key": "66cf552f525630504afb8d2b84a90f9b", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "START A CONVERSATION", "href": null}, {"key": "eb6dbb25d103b8d09b844110a2972331", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Explore school collaboration →", "href": "/school-collaboration.html"}, {"key": "ee8201fc33894ae35e018146854326a7", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "a", "text": "the.elan.summit@gmail.com ↗", "href": "mailto:the.elan.summit@gmail.com"}, {"key": "a7a3a64adf5a5be1ffb0c2cde3497c43", "page": "schools.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Your enquiry is saved for the organising team. It does not reserve a place or confirm a volunteer role.", "href": null}, {"key": "4eee3d865d84c9c9615b9b86c8d799a8", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "ÉLAN / ORGANISING & VOLUNTEERING", "href": null}, {"key": "6ac7e7a9388c8bb1c2c8ffef09bb3245", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "em", "text": "next edition happen.", "href": null}, {"key": "9768fba2d47af3a9570f18185170c24d", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The experience starts with the people behind it. Tell us your interests, availability and the responsibilities you would like to take on.", "href": null}, {"key": "124e7daca89391421d93cfd9d444cb4c", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Send an enquiry ↘", "href": "#enquire"}, {"key": "77b1bf4c7331e0b128bd93813c9daa99", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "a", "text": "Questions & answers ↗", "href": "/faqs.html"}, {"key": "357124b4891596815c867a8e01328f86", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "BEHIND THE EXPERIENCE", "href": null}, {"key": "6070bd25d353b9ea19f824b1ba43863f", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "People & coordination", "href": null}, {"key": "a01e9bbe349fa5d5013820b1faab39c9", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Registration, participant support, hospitality, guest coordination and audience movement.", "href": null}, {"key": "d5383d843b6eda9d47e7edf52e76b247", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Programme & production", "href": null}, {"key": "874a44c8b0e764c61ce5205f887368ec", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Crisis Command support, room readiness, stage cues, schedules and logistics.", "href": null}, {"key": "cd0b2dbf966ddec6a8ce66fa17c7f1aa", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Media & storytelling", "href": null}, {"key": "f9dffe010db2ba840b9cdaba4143522b", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Photography, film, design, interviews and event communication.", "href": null}, {"key": "55f8d2c595819708055ee353b426d40a", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Before you commit", "href": null}, {"key": "cf9de39b8a8032092b27479e8babdddb", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The team will confirm available roles, selection, responsibilities, briefing and dates. An enquiry is not a confirmed appointment.", "href": null}, {"key": "c51f0f3ed325dfecf57393d054f8d2c0", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Tell us what you need.", "href": null}, {"key": "ad26b55b61e861d2f9b100be4c8db6f6", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Share your school, interests or question, along with a way to reach you.", "href": null}, {"key": "06104d944e9828a3fd17e95dcca18cf4", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "We’ll take it from there.", "href": null}, {"key": "6b80fd01dd5eb17371f1b73d6becab18", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "The organising team reviews your message and follows up using the details you provide.", "href": null}, {"key": "cbc02e147ae63a75a0b9a2b773dc3b53", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "h3", "text": "Agree the details.", "href": null}, {"key": "21f5253def600e70f229698f69694f80", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Dates, responsibilities and any costs are confirmed before you commit.", "href": null}, {"key": "182b1f1e0027e2d2c218dc26747c5e91", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "START A CONVERSATION", "href": null}, {"key": "9b12174b7e17bf65d7350f4b6e362a7b", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Share relevant experience if you have it, and tell us what you would like to learn. Roles for the second edition are still being planned.", "href": null}, {"key": "0fb6e912491df08b3fe97eb3780351bd", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "a", "text": "the.elan.summit@gmail.com ↗", "href": "mailto:the.elan.summit@gmail.com"}, {"key": "96ee4bf87f9aaf19ee38ca6903c4a4f9", "page": "volunteers.html", "tag": "p", "text": "Your enquiry is saved for the organising team. It does not reserve a place or confirm a volunteer role.", "href": null}]